! Energy-Dependent wall reactions for the anode.
! Format:
!   reactant --> product
!   probability  E_min_eV  E_max_eV
!
! Philosophy:
! - low-energy particles are mostly absorbed
! - higher-energy ions can be neutralized and then reflected by energy_cll
! - reflection probability is kept moderate to avoid heavy-particle buildup

